# Product Purchase

This guide explains how buyers purchase digital products on the Codexeron Marketplace.

The purchase process is designed to provide a secure and simple experience for customers.

---

# Purchase Overview

A typical purchase workflow includes:

1. Discover a product.
2. Review product details.
3. Add the product to purchase flow.
4. Complete payment.
5. Receive order confirmation.
6. Access product files.
7. Receive license information.

---

# Before Purchasing

Before completing a purchase, buyers should review:

- Product description
- Features
- Requirements
- Compatibility information
- License terms
- Seller information
- Available documentation

Understanding product details helps ensure the product meets your needs.

---

# Creating an Order

When purchasing a product, an order record is created.

An order may include:

- Order ID
- Product information
- Buyer information
- Payment status
- License information
- Purchase date

---

# Payment Confirmation

After payment is completed:

- The order status is updated.
- Purchase ownership is recorded.
- License information is generated when applicable.
- Download access becomes available.

---

# Digital Product Access

After a successful purchase, buyers can access purchased products through their account.

Available features may include:

- Product downloads
- License details
- Update access
- Purchase history

---

# Order Status

Orders may have different statuses:

| Status | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| Pending | Payment or order processing is waiting. |
| Completed | Purchase has been successfully completed. |
| Failed | Payment or order processing was unsuccessful. |
| Cancelled | The order has been cancelled. |

---

# Purchase Security

For a secure purchasing experience:

- Use your own account.
- Keep account credentials secure.
- Download products only through Codexeron.
- Verify product information before purchasing.

---

# Purchase Records

Completed purchases are stored in your account.

Purchase records help you:

- Access purchased products.
- Manage licenses.
- Review previous orders.
- Receive future updates.

---

# Support

If you experience issues with a purchase:

- Check your order status.
- Verify payment information.
- Review product documentation.
- Contact support when necessary.

